                {"_type": "UMLSequenceDiagram", "_id": "Seq_Admin_Pengumuman", "_parent": {"$ref": "Seq_Admin_Pengumuman_Interaction"}, "name": "Kelola Pengumuman Sequence Diagram", "ownedViews": [],
                  "documentation": "Participants: Admin (Web), Web Admin UI, Pengumuman Service, Notifikasi Service, Database.\n\nList: Admin buka menu, UI minta daftar, Service SELECT announcements LEFT JOIN attachments.\nTambah: Admin isi judul/konten/target, (opsional) upload lampiran, UI create, Service INSERT announcements (attachments jika ada), DB OK, UI sukses, kirim notifikasi ke target audience, selesai.\nEdit/Hapus: Mirip alur tambah dengan UPDATE/DELETE dan refresh."
                }
              ]
            },
